PROJECT: AAVE

Core Insights

Insight 1: Transisi arsitektur dari P2P ke pooled liquidity kemudian ke hub-and-spoke mencerminkan evolusi alami menuju efisiensi modal dan isolasi risiko
Explanation: Aave bermula sebagai ETHLend (P2P lending) pada 2017, beralih ke model liquidity pool dengan Aave V1 (2020), memperkenalkan aTokens dan debt tokenization di V2 (2020), isolation mode dan cross-chain di V3 (2022), hingga arsitektur hub-and-spoke di V4 (2026) yang memisahkan likuiditas (Hub) dari logika peminjaman berisiko (Spoke)【Phase 3 — EV-001】【Phase 3 — EV-003】【Phase 3 — EV-005】【Phase 3 — EV-011】【Phase 3 — EV-020】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 4 — Architecture】
Evidence: Setiap major version mengatasi bottleneck versi sebelumnya: matching efficiency → capital efficiency → cross-chain fragmentation → unified liquidity with risk isolation
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 Historical Events, Phase 4 Architecture Evolution Technical Upgrade History
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 2: Desentralisasi progresif melalui tokenomics (Aavenomics) dan governance on-chain menciptakan DAO yang matang dengan kendali penuh atas protokol dan treasury
Explanation: Dari founder-led (2017-2020) → Aavenomics announced Jul 2020 dengan Safety Module dan governance token AAVE【Phase 3 — EV-007】→ AIP-1 activates Safety Module incentives Sep 2020【Phase 3 — EV-008】→ Governance V2 on-chain voting Mar 2021【Phase 3 — EV-012】→ Aave Will Win proposal passed Apr 2026 dengan 75% support untuk fund core contributor【Phase 3 — EV-029】→ Aligned Delegates Framework proposed untuk delegate accountability【Phase 2 — Entity 80】
Evidence: Token AAVE fixed supply 16M sejak TGE Oct 2020; stkAAVE ~3.2M staked di Safety Module Jul 2026; DAO treasury $329M incl AAVE / $132.7M ex-AAVE【Phase 6 — Token Information】【Phase 5 — Treasury】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-007 EV-008 EV-012 EV-029, Phase 6 Governance Utility, Phase 2 Entity 12 Entity 80, Phase 5 Treasury
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 3: Diversifikasi revenue multi-stream (lending fees + stablecoin GHO + Chainlink SVR + app fees) menciptakan financial sustainability tanpa bergantung single revenue source
Explanation: Protocol revenue 2025 $907M fees; 2026 YTD $333M; cumulative $2.21B fees; annualized net revenue $103.68M【Phase 5 — Revenue History】; GHO revenue >$14M annualized【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】; Chainlink SVR sebagai revenue stream tambahan【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】; buyback $50M/year dari protocol revenue【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】
