Explanation: V1 Jan 2020 Ethereum【Phase 3 — EV-005】; V2 Dec 2020 Ethereum【Phase 3 — EV-011】; V3 6 chains Mar 2022 tapi Ethereum mainnet delayed ke Jan 2023【Phase 3 — EV-020】【Phase 3 — EV-022】; V4 Ethereum Mar 2026, Avalanche Jul 2026【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 3 — EV-032】
