Decision Framework

Step 1: Observe — Identify market gap, technical bottleneck, atau user need
Explanation: ETHLend founding: P2P lending gap di early Ethereum (2017)【Phase 3 — EV-001】; V1→V2: capital inefficiency, non-tokenized positions, ETH native complexity【Phase 4 — Architecture V1】; V2→V3: cross-chain fragmentation, isolation mode need【Phase 3 — EV-020】; V3→V4: liquidity fragmentation across markets, risk isolation need【Phase 4 — Architecture V4】; Institutional need: KYC/AML compliance gap【Phase 3 — EV-015】; Stablecoin need: revenue diversification, token utility【Phase 3 — EV-024】
Evidence: Setiap major decision rooted in observed problem tidak arbitrary feature addition
